# Store every text file with LF in the repository, and check it out as LF.
#
# Without this, an editor or tool on Windows/WSL can rewrite a file as CRLF and
# git reports every line as changed. That is exactly what happened here: 40
# files once showed as 36,010 insertions and 36,010 deletions with no content
# difference at all. History has always been LF; only working trees drifted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted — doing so corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pyc binary
